---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Garment Finishing & Flatwork Ironers | Gartech Global" description="Industrial garment finishing equipment, flatwork bed sheet ironers, vacuum ironing tables, and steam boilers from Gartech Global.">

  <!-- DARK HERO -->
  <section class="bg-zinc-950 text-white py-14 md:py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-b border-zinc-800 industrial-grid-dark">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-neutral-400 mb-6">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">HOME</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-purple-400">GARMENT FINISHING</span>
      </div>
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/20 text-purple-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        Flatwork Ironers &bull; Vacuum Tables &bull; Steam Boilers
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight mb-4">Garment Finishing &amp; Flatwork Systems</h1>
      <p class="text-neutral-400 text-base md:text-lg max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mb-8">
        The final stage determines customer perception. Gartech engineers industrial heated roller ironers, pneumatic steam presses, and vacuum tables for hotel linen and export-grade garments.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="/contact?category=finishing" class="px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-zinc-950 bg-white rounded-full hover:bg-neutral-200 transition-all">Request Price Quote</a>
        <a href="/steam-press-machines" class="px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white bg-white/10 border border-white/15 rounded-full hover:bg-white/15 transition-all">Explore Steam Press Range</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FINISHING PORTFOLIO -->
  <section class="w-full py-16 bg-[#EFF1F5] industrial-grid border-b border-neutral-300">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12">

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border-t-4 border-t-purple-600 border-x border-b border-neutral-200 p-7 shadow-md">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-bold bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 border border-purple-200">Up to 3.2 M Roll</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-zinc-950 mt-4 mb-2">Flatwork Bed Sheet Ironers</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-5">Single, double, and triple-roller industrial ironers processing up to 250 sheets/hr at 12 m/min feed speeds.</p>
          <div class="bg-neutral-100 border border-neutral-200 rounded-xl p-3.5 text-xs font-mono text-neutral-700 space-y-1 mb-5">
            <p>&bull; Roller Width: 1,800 to 3,200 mm</p>
            <p>&bull; Heating: Steam / Electric / Thermic</p>
            <p>&bull; Base Price: ₹ 7,20,000* (GFI-3000)</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/contact?model=GFI-3000" class="block w-full py-2.5 text-center rounded-xl bg-zinc-950 text-white text-xs font-bold hover:bg-purple-600 transition-colors">Get Quote</a>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border-t-4 border-t-blue-600 border-x border-b border-neutral-200 p-7 shadow-md">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-bold bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 border border-blue-200">120 Pieces / Hr</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-zinc-950 mt-4 mb-2">Pneumatic Steam Presses</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-5">Precision shirt, trouser, and collar presses with Teflon-coated aluminum heads and high-suction vacuum bucks.</p>
          <div class="bg-neutral-100 border border-neutral-200 rounded-xl p-3.5 text-xs font-mono text-neutral-700 space-y-1 mb-5">
            <p>&bull; Model: Steam Press Model Alpha</p>
            <p>&bull; Vacuum: 0.55 kW Built-in Motor</p>
            <p>&bull; Base Price: ₹ 1,75,000*</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/steam-press-machines/model-alpha" class="block w-full py-2.5 text-center rounded-xl bg-zinc-950 text-white text-xs font-bold hover:bg-blue-600 transition-colors">View Model Alpha</a>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border-t-4 border-t-amber-500 border-x border-b border-neutral-200 p-7 shadow-md">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-bold bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 border border-amber-200">Zero Fabric Shine</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-zinc-950 mt-4 mb-2">Vacuum Ironing Tables &amp; Boilers</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-5">Heated buck vacuum tables paired with compact electric or gas-fired IBR/non-IBR steam generators for dry cleaners.</p>
          <div class="bg-neutral-100 border border-neutral-200 rounded-xl p-3.5 text-xs font-mono text-neutral-700 space-y-1 mb-5">
            <p>&bull; Suction: Instant moisture draw</p>
            <p>&bull; Steam: 4 - 6 bar dry saturated steam</p>
            <p>&bull; Add-on: Sleeve buck &amp; spotting gun</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/contact?category=finishing" class="block w-full py-2.5 text-center rounded-xl bg-zinc-950 text-white text-xs font-bold hover:bg-amber-600 transition-colors">Get Quote</a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
